					<<link [[그냥 둔다|Hallways Rape Let]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<generatesv3>>A <<person3>><<person>> walks down the hall, when suddenly you spot a <<person1>><<person>> emerge from a classroom and clamp a hand over the <<person3>><<personssimple>> mouth from behind. The <<person1>><<person>> whispers something into the <<person3>><<persons>> ear, then pulls <<him>> back into the classroom.
				<br><br>
				A <<person2>><<person>> follows closely behind, keeping watch over the hall for anyone who might intervene.
				<br><br>

				<<if $rapetrait is 1>>
					A sudden heat rises within your loins, as a part of you wishes that had been you.<<arousal 250>><<garousal>>
				<<else>>
					It scares you to think that things like this happen in this school on a regular basis.<<stress 5>><<trauma 3>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
				<</if>>
				<br><br>

				<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<if !$worn.lower.type.includes("naked")>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_locker">>
				<<lockerevent>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<addinlineevent "hallways_locker_victim">>
			<<set $lock to 0>>
			복도를 걸어가다 보니, 사물함에서 뭔가 소리가 들린다. 가까이 다가가니 쾅쾅거리는 소리와 안에서 나오는 목소리가 들린다.
			<br><br>
			<span class="purple">누군가가 갇혀 있다.</span>
			<br><br>
			<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
				<span class="blue">당신의 양팔이 구속되어 있지만 않았다면,</span> 문을 따줄 수 있을 것 같았다.
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 100>>
				<<link [[자물쇠를 따서 빼내주려 한다 (0:02)|Hallways Locker Victim]]>><<pass 2>><<set $phase to 0>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<link [[도와줄 선생님을 찾는다 (0:03)|Hallways Locker Victim]]>><<pass 3>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<bratTaxCalc>>
			<<if $sadism gte 300 or $delinquency gte 600 or ($soldCount gte 1 and $money lt $rentMoney + ($babyRent or 0) + $baileyBratTax)>>
				<<link [[Demand money to help (0:10)|Hallways Locker Victim]]>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<if $soldCount gte 1 and $money lt $rentMoney + ($babyRent or 0) + $baileyBratTax>><<note "You need money for Bailey!" "red">><<else>><<note "Cash?" "gold">><</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<link [[무시한다|Hallways Locker Victim]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<addinlineevent "hallways_stalker">>
			<<generatey1>><<generateyv2>>
			A <<person1>><<persons>> stalking a <<person2>><<person>> through the hallway. The <<person1>><<persons>> expression is intense, <<his>> intentions do not look friendly,
			<<person2>><<print either(
				"하지만 그 <<person>>【은는】 눈치채지 못했다. 아직은.",
				"그리고 <<person>>【은는】 겁에 질린 표정이다.",
				"그리고 그 <<person>>【은는】 겁먹은 표정이다.",
				"하지만 그 <<person>>【은는】 전혀 알아채지 못하는 것 같다.")>>
			<br><br>
			<span class="purple">주변에 선생님은 보이지 않는다.</span>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[개입한다 (0:02)|Hallways Stalker Intervention]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[선생님의 관심을 끈다 (0:01)|Hallways Stalker Intervention]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[무시한다|Hallways Stalker Intervention]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<if $hypnosis_traits.suggestion gt 0 and $settings.hypnosisEnabled and !pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_hypnosis">>
				<<generatey1>><<person1>><<his>> 사물함 앞에서 허리를 굽히고 있는 <<person>>【을를】 지나친다.
				<br><br>
				<<hypnosisText "<span class='blue'>의식 어딘가가 흔들리며, 마치 최면 상태로 들어가는 듯한 느낌이 든다.</span>">> 음란한 생각이 스친다.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[엉덩이를 때린다|Hallways Hypnosis Spank]]>><<def 1>><<hypnotised 1>><<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><<detention 3>><</link>><<gdelinquency>><<ltrauma>><<llstress>>
				<br>
				<<link [[저항한다|Hallways Hypnosis Spank Resist]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 `$hypnosis_traits.suggestion * 200`>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<addinlineevent "hallways_chat">>
			<<generatey1>>한 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신에게 다가온다. "<<print either("안녕", "야", "안녕")>>." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. 뭔가 말을 하고 싶어 하는 눈치다.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[잡담한다 (0:05)|Hallways Encounter]]>><<pass 5>><<trauma -6>><<stress -12>><</link>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>>
			<br>
			<<link [[무시한다|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>

		<<if $studentCondomPrank and !$studentCondomPrank.npc.seen and Time.date.timeStamp gte $studentCondomPrank.npc.start>>
			<<if Time.date.timeStamp lt $studentCondomPrank.npc.end>>
				<<addinlineevent "hallways_condom_prank" 30>>
					<<unset $studentCondomPrank>>

					<<generatesf1>> 배가 눈에 띄게 부른 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 배에 손을 올린 채 당신 곁을 지나간다. 예전에 사물함을 털 때 콘돔에 구멍을 냈던 기억이 떠오른다.
					<br><br>

					Before you can get another look, the <<persons>> already gone. <span class="lewd">You're left wondering if that pregnancy was your doing.</span>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</addinlineevent>>
			<<else>>
				<<unset $studentCondomPrank>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<if $xchange_fame gte 800 and !$weekly.hallways_spike and !$daily.xchangeHallwayEvent>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_spike">>
				<<set $weekly.hallways_spike to 1>>
				<<set $daily.xchangeHallwayEvent to true>>
				<<set $phase to 0>>
				As you walk down the hallway, someone crowds in behind you. A hand grabs you! Fingers hook your jaw and something small presses against your lips.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Pull away (0:02)|Hallways Spike]]>><<pass 2>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
				<br>
				<<if $promiscuity gte 15>>
					<<link [[Let it happen (0:01)|Hallways Spike]]>><<pass 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<if $cool lt 60 and getTransformParts(["tail"]).length gte 1>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_tail_pulling">>
				<<generates1>><<person1>>
				복도를 걷고 있는데 누군가 꼬리를 잡고 당긴다.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
				<br><br>

				꺄악 비명을 지르며 홱 돌아보자, 바로 뒤에 한 <<person>>【이가】 있고 조금 떨어진 곳에 <<his>> 친구들이 모여 있다. 그들은 모두 당신을 비웃고 있다.<<trauma 5>><<gtrauma>>
				<br><br>

				<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
					<<link [[짖는다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<wolfgirl>>
					<br>
				<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6>>
					<<link [[쉿 소리를 낸다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>><<cat>>
					<br>
				<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6>>
					<<link [[비명을 지른다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>><<fox>>
					<br>
				<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6>>
					<<link [[끼익 소리를 지른다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 5>><</link>><<harpy>>
					<br>
				<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6>>
					<<link [[들이받는다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 6>><</link>><<cow>>
					<br>
				<</if>>

				<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("demon") gte 6>>
					<<link [[자극한다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<demon>>
					<br>
				<</if>>

				<<link [[계속 걷는다|Hallways Tailpull React]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<set _tfParts to getTransformParts(["ears", "wings", "tail"])>>
		<<if _tfParts.length gte 1>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_transform_petting">>
				<<generates1>><<person1>>
				한 <<person>>【이가】 다가와 인사한다. 몇 마디 가벼운 인사를 나누지만, <<hes>> 노골적으로 당신의 인간이 아닌 <<if _tfParts.includes("ears") or _tfParts.includes("wings") or _tfParts.length gte 2>>부위들을<<else>>부위를<</if>> 빤히 쳐다본다. <<set $selectedtfpart to _tfParts.pluck()>>"이상하게 들릴지 모르지만, 네 <<tfPartKr>> 좀 만져봐도 돼? 진짜 멋있어 보여서."
				<br><br>

				<<link [[동의한다 (0:05)|Hallways Transformation Petting Agree]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[거절한다|Hallways Transformation Petting End]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<if $perfumery?.active and !$daily.perfumeryHallway>>
			<<set _perfumeryWeight to setup.perfumeryEncounters.poolWeight("hallway")>>
			<<if _perfumeryWeight gt 0>><<addevent "perfumeryHallwayEncounter" _perfumeryWeight>><</if>>
		<</if>>

		/* Nail-themed ambient events. Gated on playerNailsNoticeable: long nails or active manicure, and not a cat player (sheathed claws).
		Skipped while exposed: nobody comments on nails when the player is undressed. */
		<<playerNailsNoticeable>>
		<<if _nailsNoticeable and $exposed lte 0>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_nail_compliment">>
				<<generates1>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> falls into step beside you and catches sight of your hands. "Wait... your nails look great. Are they your own?"
				<br><br>
				<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
				<<case "meek">>
					You nod, a little flustered, and tuck your hands into your sleeves.
				<<case "shy">>
					You nod, cheeks warming, and curl your fingers shyly against your palms.
				<<case "polite">>
					"Yes, they are, thank you," you say, holding them up for a moment.
				<<case "confident">>
					"All mine," you say, holding them up so <<he>> can get a better look.
				<<case "bratty">>
					"Obviously," you say, splaying your fingers for emphasis.
				<<case "docile">>
					"Y-yes, they're mine," you say softly, holding them out for <<him>> to look at.
				<<case "flamboyant">>
					"All mine," you say with a smile, fanning your fingers out.
				<<case "cruel">>
					"Obviously," you say, splaying your fingers for emphasis and looking <<him>> over.
				<<default>>
					"All mine," you say, holding them up.
				<</switch>>
				<<He>> makes a small impressed noise and walks on. The compliment leaves a warmth behind it.<<lstress>><<stress -2>>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</addinlineevent>>

			<<addinlineevent "hallways_nail_question">>
				<<generatey1>><<person1>>
				A younger <<person>> stops you in the corridor, clutching their books to their chest. "S-Sorry... sorry. Um. Your nails. How do you keep them like that? Mine just <<if $player.gender_appearance is "m">>break before I can do anything with them<<else>>split or chip the second I try<</if>>."
				<br><br>
				<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
				<<case "meek">>
					You mumble something about being careful with them, and the <<personssimple>> face lights up like you've shared a secret.
				<<case "shy">>
					You quietly mention being careful with them, and the <<personssimple>> face lights up like you've shared a secret.
				<<case "polite">>
					You politely offer a few tips about keeping them dry and filing in one direction, and the <<personssimple>> face lights up like you've shared a secret.
				<<case "confident">>
					You list a few clear rules: keep them dry, file in one direction, and don't pick at the edges. The <<personsimple>> listens like you're a small oracle.
				<<case "bratty">>
					"Stop biting them, for starters," you say. The <<personsimple>> looks startled, then laughs.
				<<case "docile">>
					You gently offer a few tips: keep them dry, file in one direction, don't pick at the edges. The <<personsimple>> listens like you're a small oracle.
				<<case "flamboyant">>
					You share your favourite tips with a smile: keep them dry, file in one direction, don't pick at the edges. The <<personsimple>> listens like you're a small oracle.
				<<case "cruel">>
					"Stop biting them, for starters," you say flatly. "And stop picking at them." The <<personsimple>> looks startled, then laughs.
				<<default>>
					You offer a few honest tips to keep them dry, file in one direction, don't pick at the edges. The <<personsimple>> listens like you're a small oracle.
				<</switch>>
				The bell rings somewhere down the corridor. The <<personsimple>> thanks you and hurries off.
				<<famesocial 2>><<lstress>><<stress -1>><<gcool>>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[다음|Hallways]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		/* Divine TF ambient events: NPCs react to the aura given off by an active angel, fallen angel, or demon transformation. */
		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("demon") gte 6>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_demon_lust">>
				<<generatey1>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> coming down the hallway slows the moment <<he>> spots you, <<his>> cheeks flushing deep red.
				A couple of students nearby fall quiet too, stealing glances of their own.
				<br><br>
				<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
				<<case "meek">>
					You duck your head, feeling your own face heat up, though you can't quite hide the small, wicked smile at your mouth. "See something you like?"
				<<case "shy">>
					You glance down, feeling your own face heat up, though you can't quite hide the small, wicked smile at your mouth. "S-see something you like?"
				<<case "polite">>
					You incline your head with a polite smile, feeling your own face heat up. "Do you see something you like?"
				<<case "confident">>
					You hold <<his>> stare and let a slow smile spread across your face. "See something you like?"
				<<case "bratty">>
					You catch <<his>> eye and slowly lick your lips. "See something you like?"
				<<case "docile">>
					You lower your eyes, a soft smile on your lips, feeling your own face heat up. "Do you... see something you like?"
				<<case "flamboyant">>
					You tilt your head and give <<him>> a dazzling smile, feeling your own face heat up. "See something you like?"
				<<case "cruel">>
					You catch <<his>> eye and slowly lick your lips, enjoying how uneasy it makes <<him>>. "See something you like?"
				<<default>>
					"See something you like?" Your eyes stay locked on <<his>> as you drag your tongue over your lips, enjoying the way <<he>> squirms under your attention.
				<</switch>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> freezes under your stare, gaze dropping to your mouth before snapping back up.
				"Maybe I do," <<he>> says. "You going to do something about it?"
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Hallways Demon Lust Reaction]]>><<speechcarry "Hallways Demon Lust Reaction">><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("fallen") gte 2>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_fallen_mellow">>
				<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
				The energy of the hallway seems to dim as you pass. A <<person>> glances at you, then looks away.
				<<person2>><<His>> friend does the same, voice dropping to little more than a murmur. <<person1>>No one gets in your way.
				No one calls after you. Conversations thin out as you pass, laughter dying, footsteps slowing like people have only just remembered to be careful around you.
				<br><br>
				Somehow, their action doesn't feel cruel, and it doesn't feel scary. It just makes you sad, because it reminds you that you don't fully belong anywhere anymore.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Hallways Fallen Mellow Reflection]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("angel") gte 6>>
			<<addinlineevent "hallways_angel_warmth">>
				<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
				A <<person>> passing by slows to a stop as you draw near, expression softening into something like wonder.
				<<person2>><<His>> friend follows <<person1>><<his>> gaze and does the same, a small, helpless smile spreading across <<person2>><<his>> face.
				<br><br>
				<<person1>>"Sorry, I just—" <<he>> starts, then laughs quietly at <<himself>>. "You just made everything feel warmer, standing there. Is that weird?"
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Hallways Angel Warmth Lingering]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>

		/* Each random hallway event can only be viewed once per day. */
		<<set _eventpool to _eventpool.filter(event => !$daily.school["hallways_" + event.name])>>
		<<if _eventpool.length>>
			<<run _eventpool.forEach(event => {
				event.content = '<<set $daily.school["hallways_' + event.name + '"] to true>>' + event.content;
			})>>
			<<runeventpool>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _hallwaysNoEvent to true>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "courtyard">>
	<<if $bus is "schoolfrontcourtyard">>
		<<link [[다음|School Front Courtyard]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[다음|School Rear Courtyard]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "lockerevent">>
	<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
	<<outfitChecks>>
	<<if $cool gte 240 or $worn.under_lower.type.includes("naked") or !$worn.over_lower.type.includes("naked")>>
		복도를 걷던 중 당신은 누군가 당신의 <<print !$worn.over_lower.type.includes("naked") ? $worn.over_lower.name : $worn.lower.name>>【을를】 잡아당기는 것을 느낀다.
		당신이 고개를 돌려 범인인 <<person>>【이가】 근처의 사물함 안에 천을 걸고 있는 것을 본다.
		<<He>>【이가】 사물함 문을 쾅 닫아버린다. <<stress 5>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $phase to 0>>
	<<elseif $cool gte 120>>
		복도를 걷던 중 당신은 누군가 $worn.under_lower.name의 <<print _skirtExposed ? "뒷단" : "뒤쪽 허리띠">>【을를】
		잡아당기는 것을 느낀다. 당신이 고개를 돌려 범인인 <<person>>【이가】 근처의 사물함 안에 천을 걸고 있는 것을 본다.
		<<He>>【이가】 사물함 문을 쾅 닫아버린다. 그 때문에 <<bottom>>【이가】 불편할 정도로 팽팽하게 조인다. <<pain 2>><<gpain>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $phase to 1>>
	<<else>>
		복도를 걷던 중 당신은 누군가 $worn.under_lower.name의 <<print _skirtExposed ? "앞단" : "앞쪽 허리띠">>【을를】
		잡아당기는 것을 느낀다. 아래를 내려다보니 범인인 <<person>>【이가】 근처의 사물함 안에 천을 걸고 있는 것이 보인다.
		<<He>>【이가】 사물함 문을 쾅 닫아버린다. 그 때문에 <<genitals>>【이가】 불편할 정도로 팽팽하게 조인다. <<pain 5>><<gpain>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $phase to 2>>
	<</if>>
	"이런." <<he>>【이가】 교활한 미소를 지으며 말한다. 당신이 문을 열려고 하는 사이 <<He>>【이가】 떠나버린다. <span class="purple">사물함은 잠겨 있다.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<set $lock to 100>>
	<<set $lockattempt to 0>>
	<<lockereventpassages>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "lockereventpassages">>
	<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to random($lock, 500)>>
		<<link [[자물쇠를 따려고 시도한다 (0:02)|Hallways Pick Locker Attempt]]>><<pass 2>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<stress 5>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<gstress>>
		<br>
