	<<elseif $whitneyReunionScene isnot undefined>>
		<<unset $whitneyReunionScene>>

		You're in the hallway when Whitney steps in front of your path. <<His>> goons flank you, preventing escape. "There you are, <<bitch>>," Whitney says, looking aggravated. "What? You didn't think I'd notice when my favourite slut goes missing?" <<whitneyMaskAside>>You're unable to respond as <<he>> presses <<his>> lips against your mouth, kissing you.<<takeKissVirginity "Whitney" "loveInterest">>
		<br><br>

		휘트니의 팔이 당신의 허리를 감고, <<he>>【은는】 당신의 뒷머리를 붙잡아 움직이지 못하게 한다. <<He>>【은는】 앞으로 몸을 기울여, 당신이 뒤로 젖혀지도록 만든다. <<His>> 똘마니들은 기대에 찬 눈으로 지켜보며 야유를 터뜨린다.
